# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo; Git converts to the
# platform's native ending on checkout for anything it detects as text.
* text=auto

# Shell scripts must keep LF even when checked out on Windows, or they
# fail to run under WSL/Linux/macOS (a CRLF shebang line is broken).
*.sh text eol=lf

# Windows batch files are the opposite case — keep CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: don't run line-ending conversion or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.db binary
